      <description><![CDATA[
        <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #1E293B;">
          <h3 style="color: #0F766E; margin-bottom: 4px;">FICHA PREDIAL: UPA-SA-0002</h3>
          <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-color: #CBD5E1;">
